# See Layer Configuration

## Parameters
- `row_count`: 1–6
- `roi_definitions`: per row coordinates
- `detection_backend`: CV / TFLite / ONNX
- `camera_assignment`: map camera(s) to row(s)
- `fps_target`: depends on hardware

## Example Configurationq
row_count: 3
detection_backend: TFLite
camera_assignment:
camera_1: rows 1–2
camera_2: row 3
fps_target: 20